        "id": "starheart_staff",
        "name": "Starheart Staff",
        "reason": "Increases nearby allies' Attack and Physical and Spiritual Defense when Krypto casts his Ultimate. His Ultimate heals allies and reduces enemy Attack in his path, and with this staff's bonuses, the squad becomes tougher and gains Attack, Physical Defense, and Spiritual Defense bonuses all at once.",
        "signature": false
      },
      {
        "id": "energy_mace",
        "name": "Energy Mace",
        "reason": "Increases Attack and Effect Accuracy. Since Krypto's healing and shield strength scale with his Attack, the Energy Mace's Attack bonus enhances his effectiveness as a Supporter.",
        "signature": false
      },
      {
        "id": "flash_bulb_kite",
        "name": "Flash-Bulb Kite",
        "reason": "Increases Energy gain. Krypto's passive ability lets him sniff out buried bones to gain Energy, and the Flash-Bulb Kite further boosts his Energy gain, allowing him to heal and accumulate Krypton Energy consistently.",
        "signature": false
      }
    ],
